Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.71,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha para Kamihama.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.90,0:17:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Garotas Mágicas.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.83,0:17:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Destino!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.79,0:17:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Onde eu estou?
