Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.58,0:21:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko-chan, Rena-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.78,0:22:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Por favor, me respondam!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko-chan! Rena-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.09,0:22:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Não... Essa não! Pare!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.97,0:22:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Já chega!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.22,0:22:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alguém nos ajude!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.94,0:22:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi isso?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.99,0:22:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko-chan, Rena-chan! Acordem!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.59,0:22:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko-chan! Rena-chan—
Dialogue: 10,0:22:59.48,0:23:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoko!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.84,0:23:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Já acabaram? Momoko!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.73,0:23:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que eu faço? O que eu faço?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.49,0:23:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Deve haver algo de errado comigo \N para eu ficar daquele jeito!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:17.75,0:23:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Será que eu virei uma bruxa?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:27.01,0:23:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aquilo... não era normal!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.75,0:23:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}O que eu faço?!

